  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_01",
      "hash64": "EA9DF8A57A95E017",
      "text": "¡Alto ahí! ¿Adónde te crees que vas?[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_01",
      "hash64": "C01FE0B0C3FE6700",
      "text": "Estás frente a la base del grupo Siniestro del\\nTeam Star. O sea... ¡el Escuadrón Segin![VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_02",
      "hash64": "EA9DF9A57A95E1CA",
      "text": "Exacto. Y no nos mola nada que vengan a meter\\nlas narices en nuestros asuntos.[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_02",
      "hash64": "C01FE3B0C3FE6C19",
      "text": "Lo siento, pero, si no te marchas por las buenas,\\ntendrá que ser por las malas.[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_03",
      "hash64": "EA9DFAA57A95E37D",
      "text": "¡Eh, espera un segundo! Tu cara me suena...\\nTú eres [VAR 0x0100(0000)], ¿a que sí?[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_04",
      "hash64": "EA9DF3A57A95D798",
      "text": "¿[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0909)]El niñatoLa niñata en nuestra lista negra que no tiene\\notra cosa mejor que hacer que buscar bronca\\r\\ncon nosotros?[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0909"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "8681C990FFF42607",
      "text": "A lo mejor",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "8681CA90FFF427BA",
      "text": "Me confundes con otr[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_03",
      "hash64": "C01FE2B0C3FE6A66",
      "text": "¿Ah, sí? Pues a lo mejor no te conviene pasarte\\nde list[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa.[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_04",
      "hash64": "C01FE5B0C3FE6F7F",
      "text": "Típica respuesta de alguien que se ve entre la\\nespada y la pared. ¡Muy sospechoso![VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_05",
      "hash64": "EA9DF4A57A95D94B",
      "text": "Bah, me da igual quién seas. De aquí no pasas.\\c\\nTe doy dos opciones: o te largas o nos vemos\\nlas caras. Tú decides.[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_select_03",
      "hash64": "8681CB90FFF4296D",
      "text": "¡Acepto el reto!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_select_04",
      "hash64": "8681C490FFF41D88",
      "text": "Me largo...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_05",
      "hash64": "C01FE4B0C3FE6DCC",
      "text": "Buena elección. Y ahora no nos hagas perder\\nmás el tiempo. ¡Astro la vista![VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_06",
      "hash64": "EA9DF5A57A95DAFE",
      "text": "¡Arg, no soporto a la peña que va de sobrada!\\n¡Prepárate, que de esta te vas a acordar![VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_07",
      "hash64": "EA9DF6A57A95DCB1",
      "text": "¡Arg! ¡Qué rabia más grande![VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_08",
      "hash64": "EA9DEFA57A95D0CC",
      "text": "Esto... Dices que del resto te ocupas tú, ¿no?[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_09",
      "hash64": "EA9DF0A57A95D27F",
      "text": "Pues pa ti pa siempre, compañero. ¡Astro la vista![VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_06",
      "hash64": "C01FE7B0C3FE72E5",
      "text": "Astro la... vista...[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_07",
      "hash64": "C01FE6B0C3FE7132",
      "text": "...[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_08",
      "hash64": "C01FE9B0C3FE764B",
      "text": "La chica es nueva en el escuadrón, ¿sabes? Me\\ntemo que aún tiene que pulir un poco su actitud.[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_09",
      "hash64": "C01FE8B0C3FE7498",
      "text": "Aish...[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_10",
      "hash64": "C01C7BB0C3FB858A",
      "text": "En fin, voy a entrar en la base a informar a mis\\ncompañeros.[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_11",
      "hash64": "C01C7CB0C3FB873D",
      "text": "Iremos todos a una contra ti si entras, así que tú\\nverás lo que haces, pero yo que tú me largaría.[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_12",
      "hash64": "C01C79B0C3FB8224",
      "text": "¡Astro la vista![VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
